                                        "entry_id": "8eead71c-e824-3c31-9141-8bbf7c9c6f75",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female given name from Hebrew."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9b0820a-63c5-43ba-8d3a-5549192df689",
                                                "sense_id": "1e4afad9-af59-3d8f-a58f-d435c7afc765",
                                                "text": "'Edna', forsooth! No doubt her origin and morals are quite as apocryphal as her name."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d43a3a9-e6bc-4c7d-bf93-2589f61b57a2",
                                                "sense_id": "1e4afad9-af59-3d8f-a58f-d435c7afc765",
                                                "text": "Edna also said to Tobias, The Lord of heaven restore thee, my dear brother, and grant that I may see thy children of my daughter Sara before I die."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "adcf8385-d202-49d2-8ba4-169cca04e52a",
                                                "sense_id": "1e4afad9-af59-3d8f-a58f-d435c7afc765",
                                                "text": "Conjure faces to go with these names: Edna and Joy. Then I'll tell you that Edna, who has a wicked serve, is our team beauty, and Joy is as plain and dour as they come."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bab85478-0f7a-3a9a-bf10-656c6c92dc84",
